@startuml
title State machine: Azure SQL free-tier database (appdb)

[*] --> Active

Active : dbo.DemoItems serves reads/writes
Active --> Paused : free compute limit reached\n(freeLimitExhaustionBehavior: AutoPause)

Paused : GET /api/items fails\n(500 "Unable to load demo items.\nCheck the API logs for details.")
Paused --> Active : monthly free allowance resets

@enduml
